## 11. Timing

| Option | Timing     |
| ------ | ---------- |
| `-T0`  | Paranoid   |
| `-T1`  | Sneaky     |
| `-T2`  | Polite     |
| `-T3`  | Normal     |
| `-T4`  | Aggressive |
| `-T5`  | Insane     |

### Common HTB Choice

```bash
sudo nmap -sS -p- -T4 <TARGET>
```

Faster:

```bash
sudo nmap -sS -p- -T4 --min-rate 1000 <TARGET>
```

---

## 12. Performance Options

| Option                        | Explanation                              |
| ----------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| `--min-rate 300`              | Try to maintain at least 300 packets/sec |
| `--max-retries 0`             | Disable retransmissions                  |
| `--max-retries 2`             | Limit retransmissions                    |
| `--initial-rtt-timeout 100ms` | Initial RTT timeout                      |
| `--max-rtt-timeout 1s`        | Maximum RTT timeout                      |
| `--stats-every=5s`            | Show progress every 5 seconds            |

Example:

```bash
sudo nmap -p- -T4 --min-rate 1000 --stats-every=5s <TARGET>
```

